What are we looking for?
Want to know if this job is made for you? These are some of the qualities that we value the most for this role. And if the shoe fits… don’t hesitate to apply!
Qualifications / Education:
University degree major in business, economics, engineering or other relevant business discipline with above-average academic grades. CFA and/ or MBA are a plus.
2-5 years of relevant experience in structuringProject Finance dealspreferably in theEnergy sectorin an international environment.
Collaborative and inclusive team player; embracing diversity and cross-cultural awareness and able to work effectively across functions;
Strong financial and credit analysis capabilities; eye for detail
Good presentation and communication skills;
Collaborative and able to work effectively across functions and regions;
Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment with multiple competing priorities;
Committed and dedicated individual who wants to continuously improve;
Self-motivated and willing to work in a deal oriented and deadline driven environment;
Knowledge of Legal Documentation;
Strong work ethic, positive attitude, and professional demeanor;
Fluent in English, both verbally and written. Fluent in Spanish is also a plus.
In the Portfolio Management team, we realize that the aspired excellence of our work means that we always need to have the best people in the best positions. That is why we are committed to investing in your personal growth and development. You will experience a steep learning curve. We offer you the opportunity to further develop your sector knowledge, commercial & relationship skills, financial expertise, transaction experience, and regular interaction with clients at a senior level. At the same time, we will ensure that you are always up to date on the key developments in your field and that you will continue to improve your performance. These circumstances provide an excellent opportunity for a talented individual to advance your career in a multi-cultural and international environment.
The time you spend at work, the challenges you face or the lessons you get are very important, but… What about your personal life? At ING we want your work to fulfill you in every way, and that is why we take care of even the smallest details.
